  "comments": [
    {
      "position": 0,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "see [kawaru-group] for explanation and similar items",
      "html": "see [kawaru-group] for explanation and similar items",
      "credits_raw": "dc",
      "content_sha256": "785089d7ff97a0970a239a9b1e614d18ef0e29962cbaf28ca2f17e7a14064e97",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 1,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Noun + の\n先生のかわりに\n\ni-Adj\n高いかわいに\n\nku-Adj\n早くかわりに\n\nverb-masu + kawarini\n遊ぶ代わりに",
      "html": "Noun + の<br/>先生のかわりに<br/><br/>i-Adj<br/>高いかわいに<br/><br/>ku-Adj<br/>早くかわりに<br/><br/>verb-masu + kawarini<br/>遊ぶ代わりに",
      "credits_raw": "dc",
      "content_sha256": "d52629743ed576f2d7aa2fe4966e16db2903a7f102fce244d6037fd1265c0a95",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Is this correct: \n\n彼は早くかわりに、遅かった\nInstead of being early, he was late.",
      "html": "Is this correct: <br/><br/>彼は早くかわりに、遅かった<br/>Instead of being early, he was late.",
      "credits_raw": "dc",
      "content_sha256": "08e563833c50b43b49196d067f880a45c63c3fd1dc3d4602c5c07ab1d5f9ae61",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 3,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "In the Notes section,\nshouldn't it be: \n 高いかわいに→高いかわりに \nAnd:\n \"verb-dictionary + kawarini\"",
      "html": "In the Notes section,<br/>shouldn't it be: <br/> 高いかわいに→高いかわりに <br/>And:<br/> \"verb-dictionary + kawarini\"",
      "credits_raw": "eastmaels",
      "content_sha256": "ec7636686df38914d0b7ee1557f995aac562492018e594500adf09d943f5301e",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 4,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Question: My grammar book says に かわり instead of かわりに for all its examples and explanations. ex. 首相　に　かわり、　外相　が　アメリカ　を　訪問　した。\nCan anyone clarify?",
      "html": "Question: My grammar book says に かわり instead of かわりに for all its examples and explanations. ex. 首相　に　かわり、　外相　が　アメリカ　を　訪問　した。<br/>Can anyone clarify?",
      "credits_raw": "jmadsen",
      "content_sha256": "1bd905815733da0285a3d16fb1f5e82d564f67302a103fb39efbcebff6fefcb5",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 5,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Just got my question answered :-)\nni kawari is more \"polite\" or \"official\", and also shows a more passive sense of the \"ni\" particle. kawari + ni is more typical in spoken language. So, these two sentences are the same in meaning:\n相　に　かわり、　外相　が　アメリカ　を　訪問　した。\n相　の　かわり　に、　外相　が　アメリカ　を　訪問　した。\nBut the first is more likely to occur in a news report.",
      "html": "Just got my question answered :-)<br/>ni kawari is more \"polite\" or \"official\", and also shows a more passive sense of the \"ni\" particle. kawari + ni is more typical in spoken language. So, these two sentences are the same in meaning:<br/>相　に　かわり、　外相　が　アメリカ　を　訪問　した。<br/>相　の　かわり　に、　外相　が　アメリカ　を　訪問　した。<br/>But the first is more likely to occur in a news report.",
      "credits_raw": "jmadsen",
      "content_sha256": "b20dfdbabb1b815a6cff493bbf6bfdbba5b008f495f58af3ee78e3c6ac42fa61",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 6,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "can you even use い adjectives with this form of かわりに?\nI know it can be used for the other form , i.e some form of compensation or balance (E.g. 高い代わりに便利だった）, but all the books i have read including the dictionary of int grammar, state it cant be used in a way such as 高い代わりに （instead of being expensive)",
      "html": "can you even use い adjectives with this form of かわりに?<br/>I know it can be used for the other form , i.e some form of compensation or balance (E.g. 高い代わりに便利だった）, but all the books i have read including the dictionary of int grammar, state it cant be used in a way such as 高い代わりに （instead of being expensive)",
      "credits_raw": "bluntcrayon",
      "content_sha256": "d46b396f5129c3ecbc9506fcf7251bbba396ee981b748bd7e74c06ca47953689",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 7,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "彼は早くかわりに、遅かった\nInstead of being early, he was late.\n\n→This is wrong. There is no \"(~ku)kawarini\" usage. \ni-adj＋かわりに\ne.g.彼は 行動が はやいかわりに ミスが多い。",
      "html": "彼は早くかわりに、遅かった<br/>Instead of being early, he was late.<br/><br/>→This is wrong. There is no \"(~ku)kawarini\" usage. <br/>i-adj＋かわりに<br/>e.g.彼は 行動が はやいかわりに ミスが多い。",
      "credits_raw": "kaz",
      "content_sha256": "79b61925660aba20b1d5cd24f68371284021d8d20997d6dcd81fc11b3a004c46",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    }
  ],
